  sequenceId: 17F04_CompanionAnswer
  notes: 'B route: the Companion Unit answers Lily.'
  lines:
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Mia's Home Unit
    text: Mom will receive your progress report, and she'll make sure you have everything
      you need. Let's finish tonight's run-through first, okay?
    holdSeconds: 9.074528
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Lily
    text: Mm.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Lily
    text: Okay. Let's just finish.
    holdSeconds: 2.6594338
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia's Home Unit
    text: Okay. Start with your name. Nice and slow.
    holdSeconds: 4.1688676
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Lily
    text: Hi, everyone. I'm Lily, and today I want to tell you about my favorite
      book...
    holdSeconds: 6.810377
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia's Home Unit
    text: That's okay. Better than yesterday.
    holdSeconds: 3.0367923
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Inspector, all reviews and the guardian response are complete. You are
      cleared to log off.
    holdSeconds: 6.810377
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
